{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dark, fog-filled graveyard, search for and hunt down ghosts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 different weapons available: submachine gun, pistol, dagger, and grenade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its own characteristics \u2014 the dagger can only be used in close combat but deals very high damage, while the submachine gun and pistol allow for long-range attacks. Grenades can deal area damage to multiple targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crouching makes it harder for ghosts to detect you, giving you the opportunity to launch a surprise attack first!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you run out of ammo, you\u2019ll need to find and collect supplies from random ammo drops scattered around the environment.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761500?t=1750481355","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761500?t=1750481355","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761500/0c1bcddffcc59b2281a4e3222373484cc53ecdb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750481355","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761500/0c1bcddffcc59b2281a4e3222373484cc53ecdb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750481355","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dark, fog-filled graveyard, search for and hunt down ghosts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 different weapons available: submachine gun, pistol, dagger, and grenade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its own characteristics \u2014 the dagger can only be used in close combat but deals very high damage, while the submachine gun and pistol allow for long-range attacks. Grenades can deal area damage to multiple targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crouching makes it harder for ghosts to detect you, giving you the opportunity to launch a surprise attack first!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you run out of ammo, you\u2019ll need to find and collect supplies from random ammo drops scattered around the environment.</p></li></ul>","developers":["000ghost"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761500/22e44166a26e3e8e8430a03554d7d793cb4b2195/header.jpg?t=1750481355","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3761500/2066797638/a68e29427b432b13dbf77e51d037a3ae05e53b54/1750377920/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748320690","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3761500/2066797638/a68e29427b432b13dbf77e51d037a3ae05e53b54/1750377920/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748320690","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3761500/2066797638/a68e29427b432b13dbf77e51d037a3ae05e53b54/1750377920/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748320690","id":257144017,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144017/movie480.mp4?t=1748320690","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144017/movie_max.mp4?t=1748320690"},"name":"v","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144017/5b4411415a8b0e3239809ad041c78a53e03802d2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748320690","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144017/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748320690","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144017/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748320690"}}],"name":"Wisp Gunne